{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792004432, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "E-commerce portfolio: fresh database walkthrough"}
[0.029431, "o", "\r\n== Tokens for ravi, admin, and the warehouse\r\n"]
[0.802341, "o", "\r\n== Create a product and consume its received-stock event\r\n"]
[1.647772, "o", "Catalog hint: IN_STOCK\r\n\r\n== Prepare a customer cart and an existing or new Karnataka address\r\n"]
[1.829482, "o", "\r\n== Place and replay one order; Kafka updates the availability hint\r\n"]
[2.068926, "o", "Order 01a13bc9-a941-759a-910d-357cc6310138 awaiting payment; catalog hint: SOLD_OUT\r\n"]
[2.068971, "o", "\r\n== Cancel the order; the stock event restores the hint\r\n"]
[2.208077, "o", "Order CANCELLED; catalog hint: IN_STOCK\r\n"]
[2.208142, "o", "\r\n== Verify the two captured emails without sending anything outside Mailpit\r\n"]
[2.24022, "o", "\r\nDemo passed. Order: 01a13bc9-a941-759a-910d-357cc6310138. Mailpit: http://localhost:8025\r\n"]
[2.253177, "o", "\r\n== Management-only metrics and a healthy Prometheus target\r\n"]
[10.333294, "o", "\r\n== Exercise placement, cancellation, and an out-of-stock rejection\r\n"]
[10.345026, "o", "\r\n== Tokens for asha and ravi (customers), admin, meera (warehouse) and sunita (support)\r\n"]
[10.723257, "o", "five tokens\r\n\r\n== Admin: a kettle at Rs 1,499, SKU KETTLE-1792004442; meera receives 2 units\r\n"]
[10.876896, "o", "2 on hand\r\n"]
[10.876977, "o", "\r\n== asha: a Karnataka address, 1 kettle in her cart, a quote and an order\r\n"]
[11.074993, "o", "order EC000000002, PLACED: Rs 1,499, GST included\r\n"]
[11.075059, "o", "\r\n== asha: the same request with the same key returns the same order; ravi cannot see it\r\n"]
[11.183328, "o", "one order per quote; another customer's order is not found\r\n\r\n"]
[11.183352, "o", "== The order process reserves the unit and sets up the payment\r\n"]
[11.239093, "o", "AWAITING_PAYMENT; pay at https://fake-gateway.invalid/checkout/cs_0fdd21902280410bb3c461d0d4a38984\r\n"]
[11.273296, "o", "meera sees 1 unit reserved\r\n"]
[11.273394, "o", "\r\n== asha cancels: the payment is cancelled and the unit is available again\r\n"]
[11.317654, "o", "accepted: CANCELLING\r\n"]
[11.419324, "o", "CANCELLED (CUSTOMER); 2 available\r\n"]
[11.419434, "o", "\r\n== asha orders 3 kettles: there are 2, so the order is rejected, naming the SKU\r\n"]
[11.845058, "o", "REJECTED (OUT_OF_STOCK, KETTLE-1792004442); nothing held\r\n"]
[11.845096, "o", "\r\n== sunita (support) reads it with its customer; asha cannot use support's path\r\n"]
[11.914814, "o", "customer 01a13bc9-cc8d-75e3-a98d-8273ccc8100b\r\n"]
[11.983751, "o", "the deleted address stays on the order, as a snapshot\r\n\r\nDemo passed.\r\n"]
[11.987676, "o", "\r\n== Observe durable state, queue age, and HTTP traffic through Prometheus\r\n"]
[40.641885, "o", "\r\n== Verify the provisioned dashboard and loaded operational rules\r\n"]
[41.115564, "o", "\r\nObservability demo passed. Dashboard: http://localhost:3001/d/ecommerce-operations\r\n"]
